# HAJIZ — Admin Rules

## Role
- Admin owns restaurant floor/table geometry.
- Owner/Manager can read floors per Backend auth.
- Customers see published public floor plans only.
- Do not expose private medical records without an explicit authorized Backend endpoint.

## Integration
- Use real admin APIs; do not invent contracts in the SPA.
- Prefer admin floors read endpoints for unpublished restaurants (not public floors).
- Surface `domainType` from Backend — never infer domain from category name.
- Full RTL Arabic + LTR English via i18n; no hardcoded Arabic-only admin domain screens for new work.

## Safety
- No production deploy/migrations/data changes.
- No mock rows presented as live businesses.
